Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:39.51,Hdr,,0,0,0,,April 26, 1992 - Tenno Sho (Spring)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Out of the final turn and into the straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mejiro McQueen alone in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tokai Teio is chasing him hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:10.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Kamino Kresse a step ahead - Mejiro McQueen leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:12.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,The great grey Mejiro McQueen leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:14.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Kamino Kresse in second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:17.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tokai Teio is struggling - Tokai Teio in trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:20.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's Mejiro McQueen in front! Mejiro McQueen leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Kamino Kresse second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mejiro McQueen wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mejiro McQueen - back-to-back Tenno Sho (Spring)!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,The reigning champion against the unbeaten young king
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:37.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,The winner of the duel of the century - Mejiro McQueen